  "body": "Elegant living, with space and quality at every turn. Designed to make the most of its position within Kensington Park, this beautifully appointed apartment enjoys windows on two sides, inviting an abundance of natural light inside while framing peaceful views across the surrounding park-like setting.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the entertainer's kitchen flows effortlessly into the dining, living and corner balcony areas, creating a wonderful space to gather with family and friends or simply enjoy the ease of everyday living. The generous proportions continue throughout, with spacious bedrooms, main bathroom and a superbly sized ensuite that adds an extra touch of comfort and privacy. \r\n\r\nWhat makes this home particularly special is the lifestyle that comes with living at Kensington Park. Step beyond your front door and there is so much to enjoy, from the beautifully landscaped grounds and meandering walking paths to the cafe and residents' Pool House, where a heated swimming pool, gymnasium and sauna provide the perfect place to exercise, relax or simply unwind. It is an amenity-rich way of living that makes everyday life feel a little more like being on holiday.\r\n\r\nFor those who love the outdoors, the surrounding natural beauty is equally appealing. Orewa beach and village are close by for morning walks, a refreshing swim or an evening stroll beside the water, while Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve provides a beautiful bush setting to explore. There is space to be active, space to relax and plenty of opportunity to make the most of the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPracticality is beautifully considered too, with two secure car parks and a generous lock-up providing plenty of room for bikes, beach gear, golf clubs and all the essentials for enjoying your coastal lifestyle. This is easy living in Orewa at its best. \r\n\r\nCall Sandra or Paul today to view this fabulous home or visit us in our onsite sales office Tues-Wed 10am-2pm.\r\nKensington Park Realty, Licensed REAA 2008.",
